  "details": "Hey, everyone, it's Daniil_KnyaZz. \n\nI want to suggest an age limit for VR Chat. I have come across many underage VR Chat users while playing. It would be nice to have a disclaimer when you start the game that says how old you must be to play. There are multiple users who blast loud sounds and earrape other players. VR Chat is not the healthiest place for young children to be hanging out. \n\nI think its gonna be very nice feature! (also here is example of this disclamer)",
